      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "American ice cream trucks sound too happy.\n\nThe ones I grew up with sounded like\nsomeone was about to disappear. \ud83d\ude02\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2055478341470204184",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-16T02:40:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Apparently it\u2019s \u201cweird\u201d that I:\n\n- use full punctuation;\n- write \u201cthank you\u201d instead of \u201cty\u201d;\n- and sign off my texts with my name.\n\nSincerely,\nTrevor\n\nWatch the full episode on my YouTube channel.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2055326843084116306",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-15T16:38:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "In my world, the rules are made by the people, for the people.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2055113438167237120",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-15T02:30:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I genuinely think people need to fight more about LESS serious things.\n\nFull episode is out now on my YouTube channel.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2054993647733498214",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-14T18:34:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "If you haven't already, go check out my new special, streaming only on Netflix.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2054599550967718374",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-13T16:28:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "There\u2019s nothing wrong with inheriting advantages. \n\nThe weird part is pretending you started from nowhere.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2054234143198953535",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T16:16:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Maybe confidence isn\u2019t having all the answers\u2026 maybe it\u2019s learning how to deal with not having them.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2053871252004036691",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-11T16:14:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We\u2019ve gotten so used to picking a side\u2026 that we\u2019ve forgotten how to actually think through an issue. \n\nWatch the full conversation with Katie Couric on my YouTube channel.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2053510374008184902",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-10T16:20:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "People say they don\u2019t trust journalists\u2026 \n\u2026but most of the information online still starts with journalists. That\u2019s the weird part. \n\nWatch the full episode with Katie Couric on my YouTube channel.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2053146476319248401",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-09T16:14:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Voting is basically buying a house you\u2019ve never lived in\u2026 \u2026and then finding out it\u2019s haunted after you move in. \n\nFull episode with Katie Couric out now on my YouTube channel.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2052783585405395369",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T16:12:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "youtube",
      "text": "Bret Baier showed us an authentic Chinese cultural experience: ordering a sausage from a robot",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/YqYZdxsGzk4",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-15T21:30:22+00:00",
      "type": "video_title"
